Subject: [PATCH] [mlir][linalg] Infer the integer range of linalg.index

The integer range analysis bounds an scf.for induction variable by its
loop, but knows nothing of linalg.index. Give linalg.index an external
InferIntRangeInterface model, beside its ValueBoundsOpInterface one: the
index of loop d is in [0, extent - 1] where the operands' shapes fix the
extent, and in [0, signed max - 1] otherwise, a dimension being a
non-negative index. A loop of extent 0 runs no iteration, and its index
gets no range.

---
